	"description": "Telephone Operator helps users make phone calls without manually typing phone numbers on their phone. Select or focus a phone number on the computer and use the NVDA shortcut to send the number to a phone connected to the same network. Verify the number on the phone and press CALL.\n\nTo start: Press NVDA+Alt+Z or Go to NVDA menu > Tools > Telephone Operator > Start Telephone Operator.\nOn your phone: Open the displayed address in your browser or scan the QR code shown in the dialog.\nTo send a number: Press NVDA+Alt+C after selecting or focusing the phone number.\nThe number will appear on your Phone. Verify number and Press Call button.\nTo stop: Press NVDA+Alt+Z or Go to NVDA menu > Tools > Telephone Operator > Stop Telephone Operator.",
